d result.\n\nFor example, considering a few specific cases:\n- For a Wednesday in November, the calculation is: 23 December - 3 day leap year fraction period + first day of April.\n  - Exactly 5 full weeks and a remainder of 3 days. The point is obtained as Monday if ( 3 ).\n  - Exactly 6 full weeks with a remainder of 1 day. The point is obtained as Saturday if ( 1 ).\n\nThus the method determines the day of the week for any given specific scenario where Thanksgiving is fixed.",
